    "text": "Let <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> are <math><mn>2</mn></math> non-zero and non-collinear vectors, then the largest value of <math><mi>k</mi></math> such that the non-zero vectors <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> are collinear is",
